<title>ROMANIA: Romania average one-week rate flat to 50 pct.</title>
<headline>Romania average one-week rate flat to 50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania's central bank (BNR) said on Friday the average accepted rate for its one-week funds stayed flat at 50 percent at the weekly refinancing auction.</p>
<p>The BNR's offer of 1.045 trillion lei, up from previous 940 billion, was matched on Thursday by four commercial banks which entered bids at prices equal with the minimum permitted rate of 50 percent.</p>
<p>($=3,268 lei)</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
